          "description": "Prediction Challenge! Grab the physical Mars model and move it along its orbit to the exact position where an observer on Earth would currently see it in retrograde motion. Remember, retrograde occurs when Earth is passing Mars on the inside track. The system will detect when you have placed it correctly."
